WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
(applause)

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.666
- Okay, so, Charlie, you recently

00:00:01.666 --> 00:00:03.850
had your wisdom teeth pulled.

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:07.531
So, here you are in the car
afterward. I love these videos.

00:00:07.531 --> 00:00:08.364
- Is it okay?

00:00:08.364 --> 00:00:10.260
- Yeah, it's cause they put medicine.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:11.560
- Oh, okay.
- Yeah, yeah.

00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:14.007
Where is she?

00:00:14.007 --> 00:00:15.202
(sobbing)

00:00:15.202 --> 00:00:16.520
She might be working.

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:18.431
- It's all right.
- It's okay.

00:00:18.431 --> 00:00:20.338
I love her, Dixie.

00:00:20.338 --> 00:00:21.171
- I love her, Dixie.

00:00:21.171 --> 00:00:22.178
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:22.178 --> 00:00:24.110
(audience applause)

00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:25.320
It's the weirdest thing,

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:26.660
how much I love watching people

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:28.730
coming out of the dentist
office in these videos.

00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:29.970
Do you remember any of that?

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:33.710
- I remember my whole face
was really, really numb.

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:34.970
- Oh.

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:36.950
- It was definitely,
looking back at the videos,

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:38.420
I think I had a really good reaction.

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:41.920
I did not know what to expect
at all, especially after.

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:43.230
- Oh yeah, that's right, that's right.

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:45.470
We actually, we didn't leave Dixie out.

00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:47.160
We actually have hers, as well.

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:48.260
We want to be fair here.

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:49.210
Let's play Dixie's.

00:00:50.252 --> 00:00:53.690
- Mom, literally I'm fine.

00:00:53.690 --> 00:00:55.114
Let me eat anything.

00:00:55.114 --> 00:00:56.654
- Not now, honey.

00:00:56.654 --> 00:00:57.794
- Why?

00:00:57.794 --> 00:00:59.073
- Because.

00:00:59.073 --> 00:01:00.342
- Please.

00:01:00.342 --> 00:01:02.624
I just want a burger.

00:01:02.624 --> 00:01:04.373
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:04.373 --> 00:01:06.874
(audience applaud)

00:01:06.874 --> 00:01:08.569
- Literally, I'm fine.

